&_nc_ohc=lmL353dfiPYQ7kNvwF7fMnP&_nc_oc=Adr0gNJbmPtxcwof9uK-XhSUQibAZI5HPiKTyEKcrPa53D4LUkNooB4fCo-GouHg0YU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ0XmLNSDZTFgAPyM-iH43u-kt0R0cK8zKqz56O3r3vHA&oe=6AEF55C3"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qbnLh9LY9kQ7kNvwFdRmVs&_nc_oc=Adrw0DOympYwPD4d2_6xiDL_QmPkvdBcsAzNJBpv1kHNcUkq5GU7teY1NgCMkeeeYic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWxOdms-GthcBGtu0Wpm5ya9BVH8O9f_YNVeJ8e98rGA&oe=6AEF4C4B"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lccTSS9gfjEQ7kNvwGePdst&_nc_oc=AdoKF9alED0lbDkjleI4sOLti3hOQ-p-4HYH0GWqUDu43ekl78_9QHARxaNQ6NpF2XQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSgkACckWZ0ftnsZWbk98tGRyol-89AKSYNJg1VMUEwaA&oe=6AEF6301"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rozggy68LJ4Q7kNvwF1RUOv&_nc_oc=Adr8mY0VzbGHaOIg6FD5QsEyHXpef_WZf4VogAQWEdkDm-EVuAF32Wiz0cnSyZ--LGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzi0jBtR-97qgiVMzgHMecQ8NKOMC0f84LT0iKtvE6Ew&oe=6AEF4404"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r4lTcKE8JqUQ7kNvwFySfrQ&_nc_oc=AdpYkArGqa1gPhnSPh5hY-trRgen7QPtjpFf-ZRUyFKQClOQ7YBKF5QtZTjnlhbRMs8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQGW8aNxU_hazsVTI5ZlL3zTRuK5l9CebXupO0A6coFA&oe=6AEF37C1"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8FnUMKTDHW8Q7kNvwGdfwFR&_nc_oc=Ado2hKwDSaZzNMe0gdSw0IHnk4zU90yFw7g7-rK2qkmjGxUprXrdIWzGgJrk_Oufo1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRX_DA24fM54II7tqjYZLshM6cT5BQq88Oc0MGmGKK97Q&oe=6AEF64A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jM5OMZu_OYUQ7kNvwFasn27&_nc_oc=AdoFNQ3xkAdf4LP4pl7ENNs1lSLnZHE5znG0GRyEbVH-bYuWUPllAhD4Ya0-dAQ6lNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3sLT6JA6WflC6YxwNR7aZIf179zGG-bB5b2tvtD1wdA&oe=6AEF32A4"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oSPJ0Py9mLUQ7kNvwFxsrXp&_nc_oc=AdroA8c8tR-dfO266xF0nP5F0cs9mUNYl-8h9W7dVRzUBEi6d9PqqazUPzeIjNUNQD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8MnzlM4CSrct_Wwr2vafI4FKOMfcIY0RwxIf5-Uf5lA&oe=6AEF357C"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3KMoy9cOeQQ7kNvwE5mlVT&_nc_oc=AdouEMI6dTycSFd9dsjX12s--zTbaSv8_CQRjjyAD7dC108ieH7NueW3jS4Sd94Fv00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT44w6Rhn3PyMs4SyLmPKTnjmZ-x6g7sffPdpTDLNuaYg&oe=6AEF58AE"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MZKjzkidaf4Q7kNvwEK6SdY&_nc_oc=AdrvTFVBXmxxLFDn4RruWIKof5JFvJ8pyugQInX-oNDohcqxv-yAEvQIaBPkeyFUrbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRco1_cGEBY3_vvc24uxGsNwBh3-QRKVH4F-heYQltHBw&oe=6AEF5249"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cdhyJKkpZY0Q7kNvwFjrtxY&_nc_oc=AdohFCVswcMkqUim7e65kQKZkH14gZRpHvkBso0SezrT5VUsKzgm6mvTF3g8WqiKfYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQShH24Hm7xzVU5WX-68w3YxH8_c05UqD2VKMWsxo9FYvg&oe=6AEF6216"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pa1Y2MAVhcwQ7kNvwGcedVW&_nc_oc=AdrdB2Uzuq00FS7zLvA-2WFVj5KEA6BBAUhpcOR0cyS3bVYWayMQvHSapMBjoAWu1Mo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdW8UWfb8zdPWv8Ybl_9506MqOfEFTy6w1c8KJ9i16dQ&oe=6AEF4DB2"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lAZMli1Jdn0Q7kNvwF74bwn&_nc_oc=AdrdMNf1PFeqmTeZlQ0vis1XwvCQ7fivnNvkEDS466Z1TeuSNOeEdULLzPfF_2qS9d4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSx-spIuobV2Yl-m2311u8SU9ZsqQzyldrcdiSzvDbSyQ&oe=6AEF4266"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E1QNJhuOyW0Q7kNvwFX8oBE&_nc_oc=Adrh2_8EMcjfHWcg-GdaWRmz1BwY3_avIangF-qXMAMKvH0gjAiBomd2eEp5p2z_q5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAP7cZ1g-O_NvdVXV-Kzk8j3FzdYnBQsUxb7hkw_RLJQ&oe=6AEF4623"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=faQEBVQgi8QQ7kNvwFEyhZ8&_nc_oc=AdpITlwQtrgGjkMgtBgNEs8fe5OM9Ni529v7QHJPuzPDjrjF2aBqAM74L1LUXN36IpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRzMdaHnUEIcBt-dXu5yvrQa-Do3V6GiNbTjdNIK0-fVw&oe=6AEF6663"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=byRd3kIWugcQ7kNvwH7xcel&_nc_oc=AdrA_KDSKhHAN6grmTfAoRUMzMsX8kSI4vB5wWxSI-d6lKTKai-T_is_GCkAx7XeCR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS6T_S3oLHiqjHzFReQdFo5WKbsOCOsVW4cl8wYR0B0Jw&oe=6AEF65B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g